  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "从收入上说，我的黄金时代是当我在青岛教书的时候。",
      "output_sha256": "5e94699f3d932c55676e99486ef10b582e79847a5d7c9aee9918fe607735a18a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e94699f3d932c55676e99486ef10b582e79847a5d7c9aee9918fe607735a18a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那时，我的月薪可观，此外还有稿费和版税作为额外收入，因此每月都能存下一些钱，给孩子们准备教育基金。",
      "output_sha256": "a208295996ed741ad33c0f5478169e8e332e399ade0cf4249d7c558a24181db6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.494766,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d6770645e25099ef32178ea57ca8f4b82684487d8d4f73ecd2f8660e5fe2b4a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a208295996ed741ad33c0f5478169e8e332e399ade0cf4249d7c558a24181db6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我自己还保了寿险，以便一口气接不上来，子女们不致马上挨饿。",
      "output_sha256": "70d628b2bde2843f2e3852b634d855461c25752db3ca0771e4a199fbab59763c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "70d628b2bde2843f2e3852b634d855461c25752db3ca0771e4a199fbab59763c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此外，每月我还能买几十元的书籍与杂志。",
      "output_sha256": "7798433f37f631c04f67c7fa558d90bb5696af66d71c6691e8c4c99707e42577",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "7798433f37f631c04f67c7fa558d90bb5696af66d71c6691e8c4c99707e42577",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这点点未能免俗的办法，使我在妻小面前显出得意，因为人家往往爱说文人们都吊儿郎当，有了钱不干正经事；我这样为子女储金，自己还保寿险，大概可以堵住他们的嘴吧？",
      "output_sha256": "2a4937607499dbb8f7278e1a496e1c8c4a46d215731e3e9c3821568023ea1397",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a4937607499dbb8f7278e1a496e1c8c4a46d215731e3e9c3821568023ea1397",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "七七事变后，我从青岛迁往济南的齐鲁大学。",
      "output_sha256": "48cca0ba0dc3260c982d4b7072c894ca561ef6d34a2b5d5bc80414b3a5d8b7fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.788636,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c504f45d4cbb9a08ccd6570f6dc26e1dd776f4fcdd5fde6e2bd358d1fc4722e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "48cca0ba0dc3260c982d4b7072c894ca561ef6d34a2b5d5bc80414b3a5d8b7fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书籍，我舍不得扔，故只把四大筐杂志卖掉，以减轻累赘。",
      "output_sha256": "1ad60628aadc22918ff449cc19de34f4ce077ef542d0277fe0eb9c38e5740802",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ad60628aadc22918ff449cc19de34f4ce077ef542d0277fe0eb9c38e5740802",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "四大筐杂志卖了四十个铜板！",
      "output_sha256": "c2cf895fe2cd398d32df56551d714ae8fd3faf46d6950525b184cb807a6c8b81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.784253,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f25df03c2f2cc626125e30583b95ca8e6c9dd58b36657618ba7039740be343f2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c2cf895fe2cd398d32df56551d714ae8fd3faf46d6950525b184cb807a6c8b81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书橱、火炉、小孩子的卧车和我的全份的刀枪剑戟，全部扔掉。",
      "output_sha256": "baddbeb6eff5832fdf845f1d2f0c5aa46f4670c4621bbed65681307a341ea220",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "baddbeb6eff5832fdf845f1d2f0c5aa46f4670c4621bbed65681307a341ea220",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "幸好铁路局里有朋友，帮我将重要的家具和书籍从青岛运了出来。",
      "output_sha256": "44a5765084148b7136f7dc350a3f7ad66f8851b4c6575ef9ef0d884146778e74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.613647,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "efc49dada73e26176b59512fc95706455c7e88d34649258de663ebc67770e873"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44a5765084148b7136f7dc350a3f7ad66f8851b4c6575ef9ef0d884146778e74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "当我由济南逃出来的时候，我的家小依然留在齐大。",
      "output_sha256": "69eeac802393bd480d32016e53e068013a7263864017e93ea5ccb45362783206",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "69eeac802393bd480d32016e53e068013a7263864017e93ea5ccb45362783206",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我起身之前，我把书籍、字画，全打了箱，存在齐大图书馆里。",
      "output_sha256": "a0b2ebb099db49de3795cc41437f603c559e67679e3ef1eacd9004e800d34c2d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0b2ebb099db49de3795cc41437f603c559e67679e3ef1eacd9004e800d34c2d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "后来，妻子离开济南，又将全部家具寄存在齐大，只带走一些随时穿用的衣服。",
      "output_sha256": "585f8ebba2ee0fd72052d494363f51724cceaaff120d8cbee62161a417bebb40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "585f8ebba2ee0fd72052d494363f51724cceaaff120d8cbee62161a417bebb40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "据内人来信说，儿女们的教育储金已全数等于零，因为她不屑于把它换成伪币。",
      "output_sha256": "f1191bcccb1f4b22adacb41aa4dfb39fc8c547a2acca19537ac087f95dce9ce0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "f1191bcccb1f4b22adacb41aa4dfb39fc8c547a2acca19537ac087f95dce9ce0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我的寿险由于公司是美国人经营的，在美日宣战后停业，只退还了九百元法币。",
      "output_sha256": "a64287dd3925073cb1cf661ea356ffffb36f433f2e2dd0ffe332e9841efb1fe3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.790922,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a3418234fa62d22d79e052b3cd6ca60493a494f65d91242ffed57c0dabd3962e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a64287dd3925073cb1cf661ea356ffffb36f433f2e2dd0ffe332e9841efb1fe3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这次我到成都，见到齐大的老友们。",
      "output_sha256": "3d28c5d717cccbd2ab40510d693771cce7effd1f2ed05670f74f70f432c265d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d28c5d717cccbd2ab40510d693771cce7effd1f2ed05670f74f70f432c265d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们告诉我，齐大的校舍已完全被敌人占领，大家的财物都被掳掠一空，甚至连校园里的青草也被战马啃光了。",
      "output_sha256": "8298957e63b5181a90f3b47ad2b72a51e730587d6ee942a243aade62fc1bb9b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.670392,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "602d3c83ba502ffe01dd5ea5957b9070791e0386817311c63830cf34ced0ffba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8298957e63b5181a90f3b47ad2b72a51e730587d6ee942a243aade62fc1bb9b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好，除了我、妻、儿女，五条命以外，什么也没有了！",
      "output_sha256": "e137bd2ab435ae52c461122dd702e2ef37610dd3e68209b2d848bc05339b8b8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "e137bd2ab435ae52c461122dd702e2ef37610dd3e68209b2d848bc05339b8b8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而这五条命能否有足够维持的衣食，不至于饿死，还不敢肯定的说。",
      "output_sha256": "2128d77b426a856296deea98320dc0946afc582f33f58955b776ad14b9e2a674",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "2128d77b426a856296deea98320dc0946afc582f33f58955b776ad14b9e2a674",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她们若是短命，我该归去，我也会死。",
      "output_sha256": "328708b3b4b4e2854797c55d98d41810adf109eab934e847829672b3718339cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.499073,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "451fda748221d0a34d2275a5579a6a6fae5ce9dd710e8ff0f061152316b01d11"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "328708b3b4b4e2854797c55d98d41810adf109eab934e847829672b3718339cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "反正不能因为穷困死亡而失了气节！",
      "output_sha256": "f7fbeec2bb146d01ff89925d6778cba4ed8f98a0235749edc7fa5d8c25e27e39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "f7fbeec2bb146d01ff89925d6778cba4ed8f98a0235749edc7fa5d8c25e27e39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "为了爱国，为了气节，稍微狠下心来，或许是可以被理解的吧？",
      "output_sha256": "ac2e1b644ee69fbb0b9469cabfbc695bf994e25dfe1f1d79980d7ad923b9d09a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.483656,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d416bdf861a1a9423146bab93935b4419b8d2e2be5f1b9cb5efd0f7854e0c3b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac2e1b644ee69fbb0b9469cabfbc695bf994e25dfe1f1d79980d7ad923b9d09a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "物质财富算得了什么呢！",
      "output_sha256": "5329d8fc667a15e1a792bdc205120fb3b6b1b224b6c925ce91b019a37d477aa9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.655385,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f0809b6359289073b26316615d8797e7ef31f972853139faed900c93c229972e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5329d8fc667a15e1a792bdc205120fb3b6b1b224b6c925ce91b019a37d477aa9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "未来可以再买再挣！",
      "output_sha256": "70b40c1881d2449071cbad0f557d3d9053d71b9e9f8717ad66ace4a924ca5fa8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.542484,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "439fcea71c56aa1cc1dc3f3779242d594224850a8777a59ea2a53c6b5c588e6c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "70b40c1881d2449071cbad0f557d3d9053d71b9e9f8717ad66ace4a924ca5fa8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "噢，恐怕经了这次教训，就永不购置像样儿的东西，以免患得患失，也不会再攒钱，即使是子女的教育费。",
      "output_sha256": "6ad125592d629259034b01d79f44ae619f693e9e379aa5e441b375a3dca4a8ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ad125592d629259034b01d79f44ae619f693e9e379aa5e441b375a3dca4a8ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，在抗战胜利以后，有了钱便去旅行，多认识认识国内的名山大川，或者比买了东西更有意义。",
      "output_sha256": "27005d80602c83caef817aafafbfd8a6c2d54146182a992aae195dde47a9d9f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "27005d80602c83caef817aafafbfd8a6c2d54146182a992aae195dde47a9d9f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于书籍，虽然我最为喜爱，也不应再自己收藏，而是应当放在公共图书馆中。",
      "output_sha256": "14bf8529fc87707dcf66b08190efa9277688d23b4b513d71943151854b05ecd6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.696898,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "261f86f2c259c4537f6859290dec7b106b0059ffc1e21576864bfe9b1ad6b56b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "14bf8529fc87707dcf66b08190efa9277688d23b4b513d71943151854b05ecd6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这次的损失中，说来颇觉可笑，使我连日感到不快者，倒是历年所积藏的一些字画。",
      "output_sha256": "3523d837ceb2fa8de9f505d9553a3a049604526e2a305db8efd0c82ccafd0673",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "3523d837ceb2fa8de9f505d9553a3a049604526e2a305db8efd0c82ccafd0673",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我喜爱字画，但是没有花到一个钱去买过。",
      "output_sha256": "a2dea51e89ee8617241f95abe3dde7c5958dd3db2246850901ecce43f19aa0f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2dea51e89ee8617241f95abe3dde7c5958dd3db2246850901ecce43f19aa0f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我的“收藏”里，没有苏东坡或王石谷。",
      "output_sha256": "fb7429cdd57167df9a2a897cedd63994466b044022ab20d7405c895f497f012e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb7429cdd57167df9a2a897cedd63994466b044022ab20d7405c895f497f012e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我是重感情的人，我所保存的字画都是师友们的手迹。",
      "output_sha256": "5bd04eea016969e83d2503f0487d5d102aeb711712a5de9c03ac3b31cffc5f9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "5bd04eea016969e83d2503f0487d5d102aeb711712a5de9c03ac3b31cffc5f9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其中，有的是字不高明，画不成样，但是写字作画的人是我的朋友，所以我就珍藏着它们。",
      "output_sha256": "6c5572f67f1e7b81cca9443622ef18d0830c8b346fd31217a44961c1172536ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c5572f67f1e7b81cca9443622ef18d0830c8b346fd31217a44961c1172536ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在字画本身而外，它们都有些人的关系与历史在里边，使我看见字画也就想起人来，而另有一番滋味。",
      "output_sha256": "bac70c9005d13958bef7c9da3f411f1b514c39fc9ccbbad8f6974bcca4f67d3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "bac70c9005d13958bef7c9da3f411f1b514c39fc9ccbbad8f6974bcca4f67d3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有的呢，是字好画好，而且又出于师友之手，就分外觉得可贵。",
      "output_sha256": "03b30b36c629ef624bf574a77a48f13cc81d6128bcbe8ea9dad1e18613713b88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "03b30b36c629ef624bf574a77a48f13cc81d6128bcbe8ea9dad1e18613713b88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这些，唉，也都丢失了！",
      "output_sha256": "ea45ca3bc9ea564dc0829a20f1b28fe7242fe607b40a477fe56832582724c563",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea45ca3bc9ea564dc0829a20f1b28fe7242fe607b40a477fe56832582724c563",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其中最使我念念不忘的是方唯一先生给我们写的一副对。",
      "output_sha256": "7e6cc2651cebd1026cb7fdb3ea1119a6a18b5b9a073a038e4303ed0598ffbd1d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "7e6cc2651cebd1026cb7fdb3ea1119a6a18b5b9a073a038e4303ed0598ffbd1d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "方先生的字与文的造诣都极深，我十六七岁练习古文旧诗受益于他老先生者最大。",
      "output_sha256": "b1b627765ddd7397d545c4013c61662d5f23ea6d5f71b208d2554dc1005a55c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1b627765ddd7397d545c4013c61662d5f23ea6d5f71b208d2554dc1005a55c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这一副对子是他临死以前给我写的，用笔运墨之妙，可以算他老人家的杰作。",
      "output_sha256": "82a8c55dca4cabca9aaaafac3a109ab7defb4881efb27ef6f19a13486e8588d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "82a8c55dca4cabca9aaaafac3a109ab7defb4881efb27ef6f19a13486e8588d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在战前，无论我在哪里住家，我总把它悬在最显眼的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "21137019962d84062d7fc8d2a775a72c48c6a4289302f9bb7858dd01e82744b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "21137019962d84062d7fc8d2a775a72c48c6a4289302f9bb7858dd01e82744b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我还记得它的文字：“四世传经是谓通德，一门训善惟以永年”。",
      "output_sha256": "4882fcb3314858c3a0c00e05198cf72bcfd9f06d1c08e4144fb8b2aeef048a18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "4882fcb3314858c3a0c00e05198cf72bcfd9f06d1c08e4144fb8b2aeef048a18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "方先生去世已有十年，我再去哪里寻求他的字呢？",
      "output_sha256": "3bc7d13110198db6ae40d27289eed4f4e357f2c338454dc16b3eb4c08c6a08ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.664727,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2dbf9f1cc4c5c12ad8d3f12e8c493bd7598efeb88db228f5b6fd380b5d0cdabb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3bc7d13110198db6ae40d27289eed4f4e357f2c338454dc16b3eb4c08c6a08ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次，还有松小梦的一幅山水画。",
      "output_sha256": "4a527681686430bd0e1db61bcc95ffd163b800b8b8a3dcd9689464d63732a430",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.644231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af949babf364ada0ba8a12e2c041a81060a78d28a049712d272411d62272ad92"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4a527681686430bd0e1db61bcc95ffd163b800b8b8a3dcd9689464d63732a430",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "松小梦是清末北方一位小名家，曾在山东任知县。",
      "output_sha256": "b5f33534aa370f205010b74f1fc269f0469a18a7aaa3123b0e3b12e2cde5fc82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.778598,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7615c0ae1deb250afd20bfca1339d5a49ef8828674df6d1d9cd7aca9c37c24eb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b5f33534aa370f205010b74f1fc269f0469a18a7aaa3123b0e3b12e2cde5fc82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这张画也是用稿纸画的，画得非常的雄浑。",
      "output_sha256": "5bca9a94d1ac886f189ff9df8767bd8dabf5fa73b3b8a2810837d0cc6003ab7d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "5bca9a94d1ac886f189ff9df8767bd8dabf5fa73b3b8a2810837d0cc6003ab7d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "济南有位关松坪先生，是我的好友，也是松小梦的再传弟子。",
      "output_sha256": "d175cd65e332b34e3362be62a307cd7bc285df3c03b78afdaaa2c6ebbd4cadf9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "d175cd65e332b34e3362be62a307cd7bc285df3c03b78afdaaa2c6ebbd4cadf9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "关先生在抗战的第二年去世，这幅画是他精心装裱后赠送给我的！",
      "output_sha256": "1fbece45c96027d0c5649edbb0d9dba3af46396cde3947a6ac2eb33800b50d63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.652822,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9f0c8ed71118a8e5230862c7b01ca35c335d3c3d3dafe84590663bc91035399"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1fbece45c96027d0c5649edbb0d9dba3af46396cde3947a6ac2eb33800b50d63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "松小梦的字画，在山东很容易得到；我伤心的倒是关先生的死去，我未能去吊祭，而他给我的纪念品又是这么马里马虎的丢掉，实在太对不起朋友了。",
      "output_sha256": "944edc2f8d32304fcc70cdbba3e9562e1125cffcbb59026a52e4028d189db61c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "944edc2f8d32304fcc70cdbba3e9562e1125cffcbb59026a52e4028d189db61c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此外，如颜伯龙——我最好的同学——的《牧豕图》，桑子中的油画《大明湖》，都是精美的作品，而且是结婚时他们送给的礼物，大概现在也都在济南的破货摊上堆着去了！",
      "output_sha256": "971250e68a86bd6f79bc9b8d6ceeaddf3012081067fc40338cdfbecf13bd91fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "971250e68a86bd6f79bc9b8d6ceeaddf3012081067fc40338cdfbecf13bd91fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "暂且不要为书籍的遗失而伤心吧，要保存文化，必须打倒日本军阀！",
      "output_sha256": "09c025e4b863e78fc0468c5f09902b93fe9f93bfa973facff7c7118d64353709",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.670425,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
